        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-20261109-f7d28995258f43d8b02d73d0103556dd",
        "model": "GPT-6.1"
      },
      "text": "Over 11 days, this itinerary takes you to Peru’s main historic sites, high-altitude Lake Titicaca and the Amazon for several days. You’ll see Cusco and its Inca sites, spend a day at Machu Picchu, cross the Andes to Puno and visit the floating Uros Islands and Taquile Island. Then you’ll head to Iquitos and the rainforest along the Amazon River."
